/**
• Connector WLAN Integration - Full Production
• DD7006 & DD7002B Compatible
• Complete implementation of Connector WLAN Integration Protocol v1.03
• Supports: Roller, Venetian, Roman, Honeycomb, Shangri-La, Roller Shutter,
•           Roller Gate, Awning, TDBU, Day&Night, Dimming, Curtain blinds
• 
• Based on protocol documentation: Connector WLAN Integration Protocol - 20240424.pdf
• Thank you Jcongdon01 for testing with DD7002B Hub
• Test v12 03-25-2026
 */
import groovy.json.JsonSlurper
import groovy.json.JsonOutput
import hubitat.helper.HexUtils
